// init registers this cell's error-code prefix so it never collides with the
// gocell platform or other cells (issue #1091). RegisterPrefix fail-fast panics
// at startup on a conflicting prefix; declare your codes under this namespace.
// The second argument is your Go module path (as declared in go.mod).
// External modules only need this init() call — do NOT touch gocell's
// gocellPlatformPrefixes or regenerate the platform golden (that is only for
// the gocell platform itself).
func init() {
